<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">The above Results were reviewed and recommended by the Audit Committee and were thereafter approved by the Board of Directors of the Company at its meeting held on May 01, 2019.  n  nThe figures of the last quarter are the balancing figures in respect of the full financial year and the published year to date figures upto the third quarter of the respective financial year.  n  nThe Board of Directors have recommended a Dividend of Rs. 1.40 (70%) per equity share of Rs. 2 each, subject to approval of the Members of the Company.  n  nDuring the quarter under review, 2,992 Equity Shares of Rs. 2 each were allotted under the Company's Employee Stock Option Plan - 2015. Consequently, the issued and paid-up Share Capital of the Company as on March 31, 2019 stands increased by Rs. 5,984/-.  n  nDuring the quarter under review, the Company has opened 1 Central, 5 Brand Factory, 3 aLL, 3 EBOs and closed 1 Brand Factory, 1 Central and 9 EBOs.  n  nFigures of the previous period(s) have been regrouped / reclassified wherever necessary.  n  nThe Company has adopted lnd AS 115 Revenue from Contracts with Customers' w.e.f. 01 April, 2018. The application of lnd AS 115 does not have any material impact on the financial results of the Company.  n  nThe Company has only one business segment i.e.  Fashion . </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
